04eff42-500f-51b3-ba62-293b84b5aef3" 13194139535518 true] [17592186353340 1145 "Let $u={log}_{5}⁡(5x).$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{5x\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\cdot 5=\\frac{1}{x\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}\\,⟹\\,\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\,\\text{d}u=\\frac{\\text{d}x}{x}.\n$$\n\nCalculating the limits for $u$ gives the following:\n\n| $x$ | $1$ | $5$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n\nWe now substitute and evaluate as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{1}^{5}\\frac{7{log}_{5}⁡(5x)}{x}\\,\\text{d}x & =7{\\int }_{1}^{5}{log}_{5}⁡(5x)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}x}{x} \\\\  & =7{\\int }_{1}^{2}u\\cdot \\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =7\\operatorname{ln}⁡5{\\int }_{1}^{2}u\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =7\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{2}}{2}{|}_{1}^{2} \\\\  & =7\\operatorname{ln}⁡5\\cdot (\\frac{4}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{21\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535518 true] [17592186353341 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353342 13194139535518 true] [17592186353341 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353343 13194139535518 true] [17592186353341 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353344 13194139535518 true] [17592186353341 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353345 13194139535518 true] [17592186353341 1000 #edb/ref 17592186353346 13194139535518 true] [17592186353341 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535518 true] [17592186353341 1041 "selection" 13194139535518 true] [17592186353341 1104 #edb/ref 17592186353343 13194139535518 true] [17592186353341 1110 #uuid "35a8ae4d-9fce-5505-bdd5-144817391d19" 13194139535518 true] [17592186353342 1034 "\\frac{31\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{\\sqrt{5}}" 13194139535518 true] [17592186353342 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535518 true] [17592186353342 1111 #uuid "7ceb5e7a-f5f3-5037-b333-cae220246998" 13194139535518 true] [17592186353343 1034 "\\frac{21\\operatorname{ln}⁡5}{2}" 13194139535518 true] [17592186353343 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535518 true] [17592186353343 1111 #uuid "08dd8ec2-09ec-5077-ad03-c6